---
layout: base.njk
title: Chat
bodyClass: page-text page-chat
permalink: /chat/
description: Peer-to-peer chat of Uncivilization. No accounts, no server, no history.
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
pageScript: /assets/js/chat.js
---
{#- Peer-to-peer chat (assets/js/chat.js, Trystero). Not in the menus: reached by its address only.
    Browsers find each other through public Nostr relays, then talk directly (WebRTC, encrypted).
    Nothing is stored anywhere: only people in the room at the same time see the messages. -#}
<div class="wrap chat">
  <header class="text-page__head">
    <p class="kline">[:CHAT:] · p2p</p>
    <h1 class="text-page__title">{% t "Chat", "Sohbet" %}</h1>
  </header>

  <noscript><p class="notice">{% t "The chat runs in your browser and needs JavaScript.", "Sohbet tarayıcında çalışır, JavaScript gerekiyor." %}</p></noscript>

  <form class="chat-join" id="chat-join" autocomplete="off" hidden>
    <label class="chat-field"><span class="k">{% t "name", "ad" %}</span>
      <input name="name" maxlength="24" required spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off"></label>
    <label class="chat-field"><span class="k">{% t "room", "oda" %}</span>
      <input name="room" maxlength="40" placeholder="uncvl" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off"></label>
    <label class="chat-field"><span class="k">{% t "password (optional)", "şifre (isteğe bağlı)" %}</span>
      <input name="password" type="password" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <p class="chat-join__go"><button class="btn" type="submit">{% t "join", "katıl" %} →</button></p>
  </form>

  <div class="note chat-about" id="chat-about" hidden>
    <p>{% t "No accounts, no server, no history. Messages go straight from browser to browser, encrypted; only the people in the room at the same time see them, and they're gone when you leave.", "Hesap yok, sunucu yok, geçmiş yok. Mesajlar şifreli olarak doğrudan tarayıcıdan tarayıcıya gider; yalnızca o an odada olanlar görür, çıkınca kaybolur." %}</p>
    <p class="chat-about__small">{% t "Good to know: people in the same room can see your IP address (that's how direct connections work). With a password, only people who know it can join; leave it empty for an open room. Some mobile networks block direct connections; if nobody shows up, try Wi-Fi.", "Bilmekte fayda var: aynı odadakiler IP adresini görebilir (doğrudan bağlantı böyle çalışıyor). Şifre koyarsan yalnızca şifreyi bilenler katılabilir; açık oda için boş bırak. Bazı mobil ağlar doğrudan bağlantıyı engelliyor; kimse görünmüyorsa Wi-Fi dene." %}</p>
  </div>

  <section class="chat-room" id="chat-room" aria-label="Chat room" hidden>
    <div class="chat-bar">
      <span class="chat-bar__room"># <span id="chat-room-name"></span><span class="chat-lock" id="chat-lock" hidden> · {% t "password", "şifreli" %}</span></span>
      <span class="chat-bar__count" id="chat-count"></span>
      <button class="chat-leave" id="chat-leave" type="button">{% t "leave", "çık" %}</button>
    </div>
    <p class="chat-people" id="chat-people"></p>
    <ol class="chat-log" id="chat-log" aria-live="polite"></ol>
    <form class="chat-send" id="chat-send" autocomplete="off">
      <span class="chat-send__prompt" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
      <input name="msg" maxlength="1000" aria-label="Message" enterkeyhint="send" autocomplete="off">
      <button class="btn" type="submit">{% t "send", "gönder" %}</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
